cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Clarity in your research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Clarity: a terminal chat client for reproducible prompting experiments with local LLMs"
authors:
  - family-names: Samandari
    given-names: Andalib
repository-code: "https://github.com/andalibmalit/clarity-chat"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  Clarity builds the token IDs for each call itself, sends every sampling value
  explicitly, checks that the backend used them, logs everything and can replay
  any call. It runs local models through llama.cpp or Hugging Face Transformers.
keywords:
  - large language models
  - reproducibility
  - llama.cpp
  - transformers
  - prompting
